From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: thehobbit85 <thehobbit85@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 20:40:56 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Support Steam Controller and shared Mac control mappings

Adapt seedds/nxnative PR #221 by thehobbit85 (thehobbit85@gmail.com) at source commit 5e2b1c7276e0745825f17d7875ec0e56b6913f7b to the NX2Apple pinned engine and existing input mapping carrier. Preserve fork window, screen, aspect and cursor behavior while integrating controller ownership, motion, haptics and shared preferences.

Retain the pin refresh's split Joy-Con input, per-half motion and haptic localities in the shared controller registry. Preserve the newer pointer, embedded-section and iOS game-framework behavior.

Advertise DMControllerMappings=1 in Mac app metadata so launchers can gate the shared mapping contract independently of DMSettings.

Front-ends: Gate shared DM_KEYMAP, DM_PAD_MAP and controller.<model> preferences on the DMControllerMappings capability marker. See docs/frontends.md for the exact storage contract.

Upstream-Status: forwarded seedds/nxnative#221
Reason: Provide Steam Controller support and shared Mac controller mappings on the pinned engine while the upstream pull request is pending
Issue: seedds/nxnative#221
